OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and a scattering
OL,6,Fof showers at first, perhaps more
OL,7,Ffrequent at first over County Down.
OL,8,FBecoming dry through the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith increasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with increasing bright then
OL,13,Fclear spells. Staying dry overnight
OL,14,Fwith some clear spells but high cloud
OL,15,Fgradually spilling east towards
OL,16,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
