OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry and quite bright start
OL,6,Fbut soon clouding over in the morning
OL,7,Fwith the odd spot of rain.
OL,8,FIncreasingly windy in the afternoon.
OL,9,FRain spreads east through the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,12,Fand patchy rain clearing east on
OL,13,FFriday morning. Then bright spells and
OL,14,Fa few showers on Friday and Saturday.
OL,15,FShowery rain spreads east on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
